{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果下一代iPhone產品線的關鍵零部件生產計劃出現新的時間調整。根據供應鏈最新消息，原定為蘋果2027年新款智能手機準備的顯示面板尚未進入大規模生產階段，包括iPhone 18系列與第二代iPhone Air在內的多款機型，其屏幕面板量產工作預計將於2027年1月正式啓動。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586958.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.330838+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:15:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_hash":"a165931869242c7e0998978f5af22622f00dcf3fb1085a66815c199398286cc0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}